  "releaseNotes": "v14: Migration system improvements and Source Generator support.\n- SafeGet* methods return default values when column does not exist\n- UpgradeTable automatically creates target table and indexes\n- UpgradeTable handles new columns with default values instead of referencing missing source columns\n- Migration ChangePlan execution wrapped in transactions for rollback on failure\n- Source Generator: [GenerateDao] and [GenerateChangePlan] attributes for auto-generating DAO and ChangePlan classes\n- GitHub Actions CI/CD for automated NuGet publishing",
